        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three thousand years of longing, one thousand livers devoured—<br>yet instead of ascending as an immortal, the nine-tailed fox <strong>Kim Samwol</strong> awakens as a human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drifting into the modern city, she is rescued by café owner Park Jongman and begins working at his small café. But when she discovers that Jongman is destined with the “King’s Fortune,” she must choose:<br>Devour his life to become immortal, or fall in love and embrace her fragile humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌙 <strong>Fantasy Romance Visual Novel</strong> – A mystical love story between a human and a nine-tailed fox.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦊 <strong>Fully Voiced Characters</strong> – Every character, except the protagonist, is fully voiced to bring emotions alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Beautiful Spine Animations</strong> – Characters are brought to life with smooth animations beyond static 2D.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎶 <strong>Immersive Original OST</strong> – Music directed by Shin Jun-ki (BUZZ), with multiple original soundtracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >☕ <strong>Interactive Mini-games</strong> – Serve customers in a deduction-style café minigame where dialogue hints at their drinks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💖 <strong>Multiple Endings</strong> – Choose between the path of immortality, humanity, or fading into nothingness.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Coffee Fox: Kim Samwol” is a story-rich visual novel that blends <strong>Korean mythology, romance, and modern life</strong> into an unforgettable experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta